            <div xml:id="d516">

                <pb facs="0564" n="466" sameAs="frus:frus1930v02/pg466"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.003/415: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Johnson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peiping</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-09-12T21:00:00+08:00">September 12, 1930—9
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received September 12—10:40 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>809. Legation’s 808, September 12, 11 a.m.<anchor n="64" xml:id="d516-f1"/> I am
                    informed by the British Legation that British Minister presented draft to the
                    Minister for Foreign Affairs on the 11th and that it was received without
                    comment.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Johnson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
